            {
              "Type": "Paragraph",
              "FontType": "Small",
              "Text": "Camping is a fun way to enjoy the great outdoors and take a break away from everyday life!\n\nIt also comes with some benefits, such as helpful buffs from eating a hearty campfire meal and getting to know your friends better (if you invite them to tag along).",
