          "ChapterId": "getting_started",
          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "Paragraph",
              "FontType": "Small",
              "Text": "Once you arrive at your campsite, you are free to explore at your leisure! Some campgrounds have plenty to forage, while others have spots to fish or other resources.",
