          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "Paragraph",
              "FontType": "Small",
              "Text": "Ready to rest? Cook a meal at your campfire with some rations. Different recipes grant different buffs, which will appear after sleeping.\n\nThe amount of meals you can cook depends on your tent. With the Starter Tent, only one meal can be made per trip.",
