          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "Paragraph",
              "FontType": "Small",
              "Text": "After you have eaten your fill, head to your tent and tuck in for the night. When you awake, the buffs from your previous night's meal will take effect.\n\n\n\n\nYou are free to look around a while longer, but be sure to head back home before nightfall. To leave the campsite, follow the trail out or use your tent to pack up.",
